---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/data/site";

const topics = ["Leadership", "Marriage & Family", "Evangelism", "Next Generation", "Generosity", "Men’s Ministry", "Communications", "Preaching & Teaching"];

---

<BaseLayout
  title="Speaking"
  description="Invite Aaron Joseph Hall for Scripture-centered preaching and teaching on discipleship, leadership, and life in the local church."
  path="/speaking"
>
  <section class="border-b border-ink/10 bg-parchment-dim/50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
      <p class="eyebrow">Speaking</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl max-w-3xl">Encounter Jesus.<br />Live with purpose.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-stone">Biblical, authentic, and practical teaching that helps people experience freedom in Christ, grow deeper in faith, and discover their God-given purpose.</p>
      <a href="https://sentspeakers.com/speakers/aaron-joseph-hall" class="action-link mt-8">Invite Aaron to speak</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Word comes first</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-stone">
      My priority is faithfulness to Scripture. I want the meaning of the biblical text to shape
      the message, rather than using a verse to support an idea I already have. That means paying
      attention to context, keeping Jesus and the gospel central, and helping people respond
      with faith and obedience. Stories and illustrations serve the text; they never replace it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-ink/10 bg-parchment-dim/50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20 grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] sm:items-start">
      <div class="mx-auto w-40 sm:w-48 aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-parchment shrink-0">
        <img
          src="/AaronJosephHall.jpg"
          alt={SITE.name}
          width="1500"
          height="1501"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Speaker Bio</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-stone">
          Aaron Joseph Hall is a pastor, church planter, author, and speaker based in Daphne, Alabama.
          With over a decade of ministry experience, he is passionate about preaching the Gospel,
          developing leaders, and encouraging people to live boldly in their faith.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-stone">
          Aaron is the founding and lead pastor of Jubilee City Church, where he and his wife,
          Sarah, are building a church centered on freedom, people, and purpose. His ministry
          focuses on the transforming power of God’s Word and equipping others to make a lasting impact.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-stone">
          As the author of <em>Redeem the Story</em>, Aaron shares hope, redemption, and God’s ability
          to bring purpose out of difficult seasons. Whether serving churches, conferences, or leaders,
          he encourages people to trust God’s faithfulness and live out their calling.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-pine text-parchment">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brass-light">What you can expect</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-parchment">Biblical depth. Pastoral care. Practical application.</h2>

      <p class="mt-6 text-parchment/85">
        Every gathering has a particular context. I want to understand your church or ministry,
        who will be in the room, and how the message can serve the work God is already doing among you.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-parchment/85">
        My preparation begins with prayer and Scripture. Clear explanation, thoughtful illustrations,
        and practical application help listeners carry biblical truth into the week ahead.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-parchment/85">
        Whether I'm speaking on leadership, faith, church planting, communication, discipleship,
        or another topic, I build every message around three simple elements:
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {[
          { letter: "01", label: "Open the Bible", copy: "Understand the passage in context and explain its meaning clearly, with Scripture setting the direction." },
          { letter: "02", label: "Point to Jesus", copy: "Keep the gospel at the center and encourage trust in Christ rather than confidence in ourselves." },
          { letter: "03", label: "Live the truth", copy: "Connect the message to discipleship, relationships, leadership, and faithful next steps in ordinary life." },
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-pine-dark/60 p-6">
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-brass-light">{item.letter}</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl text-parchment">{item.label}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-parchment/85">{item.copy}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-parchment/85">The aim is to serve people beyond a single gathering.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-parchment/85">
        Whether the setting is a Sunday service, retreat, conference, or leadership workshop,
        I bring the perspective of a pastor who is still learning, serving, and leading in the local church.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 font-display text-xl">
        My hope is that people leave with a deeper love for Jesus, a clearer understanding of His Word,
        and encouragement to follow Him faithfully.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="speaking-request" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20 scroll-mt-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Speaking Request</p>
    <a href="https://sentspeakers.com/speakers/aaron-joseph-hall" class="mt-6 block max-w-xs rounded-xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-5 outline-offset-4" aria-label="Visit Aaron Joseph Hall’s Sent Speakers profile">
      <img src="/sent-speakers-logo.png" alt="Sent Speakers" width="1580" height="596" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-full" />
    </a>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl">Tell us about your event</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-stone">
      For all speaking requests, visit my Sent Speakers profile. Share your dates, location,
      audience, and what you hope the gathering will accomplish.
      Please include any passage or theme, the number and length of sessions, and travel or
      honorarium details in your message. A request starts a conversation; it does not confirm a booking.
    </p>

    <a href="https://sentspeakers.com/speakers/aaron-joseph-hall" class="action-link mt-8">Request Aaron through Sent Speakers &rarr;</a>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-ink/10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow">Speaking Topics</p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-stone">
      Below, you'll find a selection of topics Aaron regularly teaches and speaks on. While these
      represent many of his key areas of focus, the list is not exhaustive. Aaron can also tailor
      a message, workshop, or presentation to fit the specific needs, audience, and context of
      your event or organization.
    </p>

    <ul class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4">
      {topics.map((topic) => (
        <li class="rounded-xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-5 font-medium text-ink">{topic}</li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-8 text-stone">Available for in-person events, virtual speaking, and podcast interviews. Contact through Sent Speakers for rates and availability.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Watch Aaron speak</h2>
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {[
        { id: "WWQEN2zNpjo", title: "Embracing the Power of Discipleship" },
        { id: "1mYVeYh5iUk", title: "The Power of Choice in Following Jesus" },
      ].map((video) => (
        <div>
          <iframe src={`https://www.youtube.com/embed/${video.id}`} title={video.title} class="aspect-video w-full rounded-xl" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg">{video.title}</h3>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Past engagements</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-stone">
      <li>Winter Splash — North Carolina</li>
      <li>Eagle Rock Camp — Tallassee, Tennessee</li>
      <li>Camp Baldwin — Elberta, Alabama (2026)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-ink/10 bg-parchment-dim/60 p-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl">Other Topics</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-stone text-sm max-w-2xl">
        Don't see exactly what you're looking for? Share what you have in mind through
        <a href="https://sentspeakers.com/speakers/aaron-joseph-hall" class="text-clay underline">Sent Speakers</a>. Aaron can tailor
        his message, workshop, or presentation to fit the needs of your audience, event, church,
        organization, or team.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
